+// Fushi patch (program binary disk cache): hands ANGLE's blob cache a disk
+// store when the embedder configured a directory
+// (|FlutterDesktopSetProgramBinaryCacheDirectory|). Never fails the manager:
+// without it every program is compiled from source, as in the stock engine.
+void Manager::InstallProgramBinaryCache() {
+  if (program_binary_cache_installed_ ||
+      ProgramBinaryCache::Global() == nullptr) {
+    // Already installed on this display (it is shared by every manager and
+    // only terminated with the last one), or no directory configured.
+    return;
+  }
+  const char* extensions = ::eglQueryString(display_, EGL_EXTENSIONS);
+  if (extensions == nullptr ||
+      !HasExtension(extensions, "EGL_ANDROID_blob_cache")) {
+    return;
+  }
+  const auto set_blob_cache_funcs =
+      reinterpret_cast<PFNEGLSETBLOBCACHEFUNCSANDROIDPROC>(
+          ::eglGetProcAddress("eglSetBlobCacheFuncsANDROID"));
+  if (set_blob_cache_funcs == nullptr) {
+    return;
+  }
+  ::eglGetError();  // Clear a stale error: the call itself returns void.
+  set_blob_cache_funcs(display_, &SetProgramBinary, &GetProgramBinary);
+  const EGLint error = ::eglGetError();
+  if (error != EGL_SUCCESS) {
+    FML_LOG(ERROR) << "Failed to install the program binary cache: EGL error "
+                   << error;
+    return;
+  }
+  program_binary_cache_installed_ = true;
+}
